{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Is <i>Liminal Shroud</i>?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Liminal Shroud</i> is a first-person horror exploration game set in surreal, liminal environments inspired by forgotten architecture, analog technology, and the uncanny feeling of being somewhere you shouldn\u2019t be. Unlike typical \u201cbackrooms\u201d games, <i>Liminal Shroud</i> blends ambient dread with interactive puzzles, mystery with a horror tone, and immersive sound design to create a truly original experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse shifting hallways, cavernous offices, and haunting liminal spaces, all while unraveling cryptic clues and surviving the creeping presence that lurks just beyond perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Makes It Unique?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Environments</strong>: Every space is original, handcrafted and deeply atmospheric.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Exploration</strong>: Discover fragments of a story hidden in the architecture and audio design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling Soundscapes</strong>: A standout sound design praised by streamers for its intensity and originality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog Horror Aesthetic</strong>: A visual style that evokes the 1970s and 80s, amplifying the nostalgic unease.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/2d5d3c0b3e6bdfb0b70ca15333de30b9.poster.avif?t=1771829397\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/2d5d3c0b3e6bdfb0b70ca15333de30b9.webm?t=1771829397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/2d5d3c0b3e6bdfb0b70ca15333de30b9.mp4?t=1771829397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the world you explore and unlock its secrets. Discover which laws of reality can be broken, but beware... This place doesn't want you to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/8f0f62a947f307fdf53f7ad48bed761d.poster.avif?t=1771829397\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/8f0f62a947f307fdf53f7ad48bed761d.webm?t=1771829397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/8f0f62a947f307fdf53f7ad48bed761d.mp4?t=1771829397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no monsters that chase you, but an inescapable dark presence watches your every move. The game has minimal UI, realistic environments and dark soundscapes to lose yourself in. Passages take many shapes and it's up to you to escape from this twisted reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features and Accessibility:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience: enable/disable scary events and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully remappable key bindings and gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit chapters you have completed in any order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera sensitivity slider,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head bob toggle,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brightness slider,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running key can set to toggle or hold down,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, minimal interface,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports windowed mode/compatible with overlay keyboards,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera FOV slider,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate volume controls for music, sound effects, master volume,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace - no timers, enemies, or precision gameplay. Puzzles are visual, no reading required to play, no dialog,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game autosaves progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEIZURE WARNING: Game contains flashing lights</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3336620?t=1771829397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3336620?t=1771829397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/58a00f76c603986fdc9fb07d6aa4644916776385/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771829397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/58a00f76c603986fdc9fb07d6aa4644916776385/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771829397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4101720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Is <i>Liminal Shroud</i>?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Liminal Shroud</i> is a first-person horror exploration game set in surreal, liminal environments inspired by forgotten architecture, analog technology, and the uncanny feeling of being somewhere you shouldn\u2019t be. Unlike typical \u201cbackrooms\u201d games, <i>Liminal Shroud</i> blends ambient dread with interactive puzzles, mystery with a horror tone, and immersive sound design to create a truly original experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse shifting hallways, cavernous offices, and haunting liminal spaces, all while unraveling cryptic clues and surviving the creeping presence that lurks just beyond perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Makes It Unique?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Environments</strong>: Every space is original, handcrafted and deeply atmospheric.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Exploration</strong>: Discover fragments of a story hidden in the architecture and audio design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling Soundscapes</strong>: A standout sound design praised by streamers for its intensity and originality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog Horror Aesthetic</strong>: A visual style that evokes the 1970s and 80s, amplifying the nostalgic unease.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/2d5d3c0b3e6bdfb0b70ca15333de30b9.poster.avif?t=1771829397\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/2d5d3c0b3e6bdfb0b70ca15333de30b9.webm?t=1771829397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/2d5d3c0b3e6bdfb0b70ca15333de30b9.mp4?t=1771829397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the world you explore and unlock its secrets. Discover which laws of reality can be broken, but beware... This place doesn't want you to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/8f0f62a947f307